TI  - Women have a higher resection rate for lung cancer and improved survival after surgery
AU  - Lautamäki, A.
AU  - Gunn, J.
AU  - Sipilä, J.
AU  - Rautava, P.
AU  - Sihvo, E.
AU  - Kytö, V.
