TI  - Time to surgery in thoracic cancers and prioritization during COVID-19: A systematic review
AU  - Fligor, S.C.
AU  - Tsikis, S.T.
AU  - Wang, S.
AU  - Ore, A.S.
AU  - Allar, B.G.
AU  - Whitlock, A.E.
