TI  - Robotic Approach Offers Similar Nodal Upstaging to Open Lobectomy for Clinical Stage I Non-small Cell Lung Cancer
AU  - Tang, A.
AU  - Raja, S.
AU  - Bribriesco, A.C.
AU  - Raymond, D.P.
AU  - Sudarshan, M.
AU  - Murthy, S.C.
AU  - Ahmad, U.
