TI  - Validation of the lung cancer staging system revisions using a large prospective clinical trial database (ACOSOG Z0030)
AU  - Fibla, J.J.
AU  - Cassivi, S.D.
AU  - Decker, P.A.
AU  - Allen, M.S.
AU  - Darling, G.E.
AU  - Landreneau, R.
