TI  - Is computed tomography follow-up of patients after lobectomy for non-small cell lung cancer of benefit in terms of survival?
AU  - Srikantharajah, D.
AU  - Ghuman, A.
AU  - Nagendran, M.
AU  - Maruthappu, M.
