TI  - Simple preoperative computed tomography image analysis shows good predictive performance for pathological vessel invasion in clinical stage IA non-small cell lung cancer
AU  - Ito, T.
AU  - Murakawa, T.
AU  - Sato, H.
AU  - Tanabe, A.
AU  - Maekawa, M.
AU  - Yoshida, Y.
