TI  - Frequency of local recurrence following segmentectomy of stage IA non-small cell lung cancer is influenced by segment localisation and width of resection margins - implications for patient selection for segmentectomy
AU  - Sienel, W.
AU  - Stremmel, C.
AU  - Kirschbaum, A.
AU  - Hinterberger, L.
AU  - Stoelben, E.
AU  - Hasse, J.
