TI  - Comparing Needle and Surgical Biopsy in Small Peripheral Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer With Suspected Pleural Invasion: A Propensity Score-Matched Study
AU  - Yun, S.
AU  - Yun, T.
AU  - Park, J.H.
