TI  - Outcome Comparison Between Left Upper Lung Lobectomy and Split Lobe Segmentectomy for Clinical Stage I Lung Cancer
AU  - Kao, T.-N.
AU  - Chiang, X.-H.
AU  - Hsu, H.-H.
AU  - Lin, M.-W.
