TI  - PP01.98 Association between pathological upstaging and overall survival among patients who received anatomic sublobar resection versus lobectomy for lung cancer
AU  - Logan, C.D.
AU  - Yang, H.C.
AU  - Jacobs, R.C.
AU  - Bell, R.D.
AU  - Lung, K.
AU  - Avella, D.
AU  - Kim, S.
AU  - Bharat, A.
