TI  - EP07.03-04 Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer in Obese Patients: Comparison of Open, Robotic and Videothoracoscopic Surgery. A Multicenter Retrospective Series
AU  - Fabbri, G.
AU  - Femia, F.
AU  - Guerrera, F.
AU  - Della Beffa, E.
