TI  - THE OUTCOME OF THE SAME ANESTHESIA EVENT FOR ROBOTIC BRONCHOSCOPY MARKING AND ROBOTIC SUB-LOBAR RESECTION OF LUNG NODULES
AU  - Hamid Alraiyes, A.
AU  - Cedeno-Rodriguez, A.R.
