TI  - Data-driven identification of plasma metabolite clusters and metabolites of interest for potential detection of early-stage non-small cell lung cancer cases versus cancer-free controls
AU  - Kim, J.O.
AU  - Balshaw, R.
AU  - Trevena, C.
AU  - Banerji, S.
AU  - Murphy, L.
AU  - Dawe, D.
