TI  - EP02.03-021 Uncertain Resection for Localized cN0M0 Non Small Cell-Lung Cancer: The Crucial Prognosis of Suboptimal Lymph Node Assessment
AU  - Vergé, R.
AU  - Rouch, A.
AU  - Renaud, C.
