TI  - EORTC-1416-LCG/ETOP 8-15 - PEARLS/KEYNOTE-091 study of pembrolizumab versus placebo for completely resected early-stage non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC): Outcomes in subgroups related to surgery, disease burden, and adjuvant chemotherapy use
AU  - O'Brien, M.E.R.
AU  - Paz-Ares, L.
