TI  - Early stage NSCLS patients’ prognostic prediction with multi-information using transformer and graph neural network model
AU  - Lian, J.
AU  - Deng, J.
AU  - Hui, E.S.
AU  - Koohi-Moghadam, M.
AU  - She, Y.
AU  - Chen, C.
