TI  - MA08.03 Adjuvant Chemotherapy for Patients with High-Risk Stage I Lung Adenocarcinoma Stratified by Epidermal Growth Factor Receptor Mutation Status
AU  - Tsutani, Y.
AU  - Ito, M.
AU  - Mimae, T.
