TI  - Positive nodal status is still a risk factor for long-term survivors of non-small cell lung cancer 5 years after complete resection
AU  - Yang, Y.H.
AU  - Kim, H.E.
AU  - Park, B.J.
AU  - Lee, S.
AU  - Park, S.Y.
