AB  - OBJECTIVE: With the progress of CT technology and the popularization of cancer screening,the number of multiple primary lung cancer(MPLC) patients is on the rise.The etiology,diagnosis and staging,comprehensive treatment methods and prognosis of MPLC have attracted much attention of clinical doctors.This study aimed to summary the current status and prospect of MPLC by reviewing the published researches.METHODS: Related articles between January 1924 and June 2018 were searched with the key words of "multiple primary lung cancer" using pubmed and web of science database.The inclusion criteria of references was as follows:(1)the etiology research of MPLC; (2)the research related to the diagnosis of MPLC; (3)the genetic research of MPLC; (4)the research related to the treatment and prognosis of MPLC.The excluding criteria was research with similar conclusions.A total of 36 references were included in the current study.RESULTS: Multiple primary lung squamous cell carcinoma is highly associated with heavy smoking,but the etiology of multiple primary lung adenocarcinoma is still unknown.At present,the identification of MPLC and lung metastasis of lung cancer is still based on a comprehensive clinical and pathological diagnosis,and accurate identification of the two faces a certain challenge.The analysis of the cloning relationship of multiple foci based on gene sequencing is still controversial.The 8th lung cancer staging system has already proposed the standard diagnosis and staging mode of MPLC,which is very practical.Though standard lobectomy is the main therapeutic principle of MPLC,the maximum retention of lung function is also essential,so sublobectomy is now a commonly used surgical strategy.The prognosis of synchronous MPLC after radical surgical resection is good,and the prognosis of these patients is closely related to the degree of lymph node metastasis.The second primary lesion of metachronous MPLC is found in the early stage of the disease,and the prognosis is closely related to the stage of second primary lesions.CONCLUSIONS The published researches have already analyzed MPLC in multiple aspects.These conclusions are of vital importance for researchers and doctors to understand MPLC and treat patients.With the number of patients more than 2 or even more "super" MPLC patients increasing gradually,the diagnosis and treatment of these diseases need further study.
