TI  - Is robotic lobectomy for NSCLC inferior to open lobectomy? let the oncologic outcomes decide
AU  - Ahmad, U.
AU  - Tang, A.
AU  - Raja, S.
AU  - Bribriesco, A.C.
AU  - Raymond, D.P.
AU  - Murthy, S.C.
