TI  - OVERALL SURVIVAL AND TUMOUR RECURRENCE AFTER VIDEO-ASSISTED THORACOSCOPIC SURGERY LOBECTOMY OF N1 POSITIVE NON-SMALL CELL LUNG CANCER IS EQUALTO OPEN RESECTION
AU  - Augustin, F.
