TI  - Prognostic value of ERCC1, ERCC2, XRCC1, and TP53 single nucleotide polymorphisms in patients with early-stage non-small cell lung cancer
AU  - Geredeli, C.
AU  - Artac, M.
AU  - Yildirim, S.
AU  - Inal, A.
AU  - Dede, I.
