TI  - Patterns of disease recurrence following either stereotactic ablative radiation therapy (SABR) or lobectomy by video-assisted thoracoscopic surgery (VATS) in stage I-II non-small cell lung cancer: Outcomes of a propensity score-matched analysis
AU  - Senan, S.
AU  - Verstegen, N.
AU  - Palma, D.A.
AU  - Rodrigues, G.
AU  - Lagerwaard, F.J.
AU  - Van Der Elst, A.
