TI  - Lobectomy in combination with radical lymphadenectomy is the most frequent surgical intervention performed in patients randomized in magrit trial evaluating MA GE- A3 antigen-specific cancer immunotherapeutic (ASCI) as adjuvant treatment in stage IB-IIIA NSCLC
AU  - Zielinski, M.
