TI  - Relationship between functional preservation after segmentectomy and volume-reduction effects after lobectomy in stage I non-small cell lung cancer patients with emphysema
AU  - Kashiwabara, K.
AU  - Sasaki, J.-I.
AU  - Mori, T.
